            "review_title": "Review at Thung Coffee",
            "review_text": "ANParish\nBusan, South Korea1106 contributions\n0\nNice atmosphere and friendly service\nFeb 2018 • Couples\nWe hadn't planned on going here, but we were really hungry when we happened upon it. The waitress outside had a menu in Vietnamese, and rushed in to get one in English for us so we could see what was offered before entering. The prices are very reasonable, and it has both indoor and outdoor seating. Some of the portion sizes are a bit wanting, but, again, at such a low price, it wasn't disappointing.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten February 8, 2018\nHaDuySon\nThankyou for leaving a review on Thung Coffee's menu experience. Thankyou so much!\nWritten February 22, 2018\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
