            "review_title": "Review at Thung Coffee",
            "review_text": "Keith\nVancouver, Canada180 contributions\n0\nDanny hipster\nDec 2017 • Solo\nThis is a very pleasant coffee/matcha bar in downtown Danang. As much as it can be the clientele were Danang booster, but no one looked askance when an old white guy walked in. Good coffee, good matcha, good air conditioning and a good choice of pastries, Reasonable English spoken. Free wifi. I liked the place.\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten December 21, 2017\nHaDuySon\nHi yurisandra! \nThankyou for leaving a review on Thung Coffee's menu experience. Thankyou so much!\nWritten February 22, 2018\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
